OL,3,GNEWSAPlea to finish D-Day veteran's war
OL,4,Amemorial dream
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have been urged to finish a
OL,7,FD-Day veteran's dream for a new war
OL,8,Fmemorial in his hometown.
OL,10,FDonald "Don" Sheppard, from Basildon in
OL,11,FEssex, spearheaded the campaign before
OL,12,Fhe died aged 104 in 2024.
OL,14,FBasildon mayor Sam Journet said the
OL,15,Flate Royal Engineer "served our country
OL,16,Fwhen it needed him most", as he
OL,17,Fappealed to Basildon Borough Council
OL,18,Ffor support.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
