OL,3,GNEWSAPlea to finish D-Day veteran's war
OL,4,Amemorial dream
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority's Conservative leader,
OL,7,FAndy Barnes, said funds would be made
OL,8,Favailable to deliver the memorial by
OL,9,FNovember 2027.
